e: (1) API readback 18 lanes -> /home/kara/code-factory, 1 primary on its worktree; (2) scripts/lane_target.py scan lanes.jsonl -> bad=0 ok=true; (3) daemon 4044334 (build d4c7393b) logged PENDING-BOOST </home/kara/code-factory> pending=46 (raw=51, 5 mid-flip) after the repoint, versus stand-in paths before it; (4) scheduler commits d43591a6 + d4c7393b pushed to origin/main."}
